    "title": "Analysts Are Neutral on Top Energy Stocks: EOG Resources (EOG), BP (BP) - The Globe and Mail",
    "url": "https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/BP/pressreleases/1094797/analysts-are-neutral-on-top-energy-stocks-eog-resources-eog-bp-bp/",
